# AI Desk

This project is **AI Desk**, a harness-agnostic workspace of AI assistants and quick tools for
everyday work — no coding required.

**The single source of truth is `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. Read it and follow it** as the full
project instructions: the start-here behavior, how to use the assistants (`agents/`), quick tools
(`skills/`), and commands (`commands/`), the routing table to `docs/`, and the golden rules (draft
first and ask before any outward action; keep `profile/` and `workspace/` private).

